<%# Live case count for one supplier in the order builder's bar: "6 cases", or
    "6 / 20 cases" against a case minimum (orange until met). Counts the same
    way the review page does (Order#item_count: every unit ordered). Updated by
    order_builder_controller#_updateCaseCounts. Locals: supplier, case_minimum. %>
<span class="text-[10px] whitespace-nowrap text-gray-500 mt-0.5"
      data-supplier-case-label="<%= supplier.id %>"
      data-case-minimum="<%= case_minimum.to_i %>">0<%= " / #{case_minimum.to_i}" if case_minimum.to_i.positive? %> cases</span>
